Let's list actions and their effects to ensure we don't delete needed things.

We'll need to be careful about detach_task_profile: it adds route_task_profile_available and removes candidate_task_profile_linked. So we need to ensure we detach at appropriate times.

We'll also need to attach_task_profile: adds candidate_task_profile_linked, removes route_task_profile_available.

We'll need to confirm_candidate_preparedness: adds candidate_prepared, no deletes.

Assign operator: adds candidate_operator_linked, removes operator_available.

Release operator: adds operator_available, removes candidate_operator_linked.

Load origin payload: adds origin_node_occupied, origin_availability_locked, origin_payload_linked, removes cargo_available.

Unload origin payload: adds origin_node_ready, origin_availability_confirmed, cargo_available, removes origin_payload_linked.

Note: unload does NOT remove origin_availability_locked (good). Also does not affect origin_node_occupied.

Activate origin node: adds origin_node_ready, no deletes (except maybe none). Precondition includes not origin_node_ready and not origin_node_occupied.

Load destination payload: similar to origin but for destination.

Unload destination payload: adds destination_node_ready, destination_availability_confirmed, cargo_available, removes destination_payload_linked.

Activate destination node: adds destination_node_ready.

Assemble_transport_leg: adds transport_leg_assigned, origin_linked, destination_linked, removes transport_leg_available.

Authorize_transport_leg_loading: adds transport_leg_loading_authorized.

Mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready: adds dispatch_ready origin.

Mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready: adds dispatch_ready destination.

Allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate: adds dispatch_allocated candidate, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked, removes dispatch_slot_available.

Execute_origin_dispatch: adds dispatched origin, vehicle_available vehicle_unit, dispatch_slot_available.

Execute_destination_dispatch: similar.

Release_compliance_certificate: adds compliance_certificate_available, removes candidate_compliance_certificate_linked.

